  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partners Assessment and Business Plan Development- FY2018/19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is undertaking an assessment of its partners to identify the capacity needs which will help them develop a Partnership Capacity Development/Strengthening Plan. Aside this, a feasibility assessment of the cassava processing centre in Kpatema community a project implemented by our partner the Missionary Sisters of the Holy Rosary(MSHR) Bo will be done to identify gaps in the business. This will be followed by the development a five year business plan for the centre.</narrative>
  </description>
